rint('top repeated coding variants',cnt.most_common(10))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"aggregated coding denom 47 syn 30 frac 0.6382978723404256\nunique coding variants with any carrier vaf<.3 23 unique syn 14 frac 0.6086956521739131\nunique all vaf<.3 variants 53\ntop repeated coding variants [(('9:5081780', 'G/A', 'synonymous_variant'), 7), (('7:102193869', 'G/A', 'synonymous_variant'), 6), (('13:28050157', 'G/A', 'missense_variant'), 4), (('7:102201571', 'A/G', 'synonymous_variant'), 3), (('2:197418581', 'T/C', 'synonymous_variant'), 3), (('19:44794197', 'A/C', 'splice_region_variant'), 3), (('4:105275794', 'A/G', 'missense_variant'), 2), (('19:44794222', 'C/T', 'missense_variant'), 2), (('X:40052404', 'C/A', 'splice_region_variant'), 2), (('7:50327696', 'C/A', 'synonymous_variant'), 2)]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
